{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016133209118-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016145518\"/><p>紅磡有人墮樓亡。今午(16日)1時03分，一名女子報案指其20多歲女兒企圖在海逸道8號輕生。救援人員接報到場前，事主已從高處墮下倒臥平台位置，救護員經檢驗後，證實女子當場身亡，警員正調查其輕生原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:20:43.914985+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:32:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:38:00.414771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:17:49.016842+00:00","content_hash":"680b541aa38119c432deac9f6f0e7f054402d5d5de8002833c59cf625f03561b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}